      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{61734d8acc7413744089269c|full_name} Using the 3.8.1 SDK release, the issue appears to be only partially resolved. The avatar prefab still fails to fully apply its changes—often defaulting back to \"none.\" A workaround is to open the prefab and manually drag the prefab asset into the slot, rather than dragging it from the scene.",
