      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{619ffdfe00e2a864e7efb2e1|full_name} Hey! Something to note here, Unity prefabs cannot reference objects from outside the prefab's hierarchy itself. That's just a unity limitation. So my general suggetstion would be to _not_ apply overrides for the vrc per platform override component. As it will not be able to copy over references to other avatars in the scene into the prefab itself.\n\nBut you can safely leave them un-applied so that the data is saved within the scene itself",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
