      "value": "@{61734d8acc7413744089269c|full_name} Well the problem with this is because Unity keeps telling me there are unapplyed changes to my prefab because of the way VRChat currently does it. The behavior should simply be corrected to look for prefabs if avaliable, regardless of what scene they are in. This would correct the behavior.",
